  "description": "The FreeDV/codec2 LDPC codes for .NET: the five datac parity-check codes (RA / dual-diagonal), a log-domain sum-product decoder (a faithful port of codec2's mpdecode_core), the repeat-accumulate encoder, and a shortening-aware frame codec for all six FreeDV datac modes (datac0/1/3/4/13/14). Matrix data transliterated verbatim from codec2 1.2.0 and validated bit-for-bit against codec2's own decode vectors. Extracted from the pdn-soundmodem packet-radio modem.",
